<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highlands Q1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highlands Q1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended September 30</p>
<p>	 (million Papua New Guinea kina unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  6.19 vs  12.74</p>
<p>    Net profit			  2.54 vs   6.96</p>
<p>    Sales				32.99 vs  35.59</p>
<p>    Other income			0.56 vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Highlands Gold Ltd is a gold miner.  </p>
<p>    Depreciation			6.25 vs   5.65</p>
<p>    Interest (net)		    0.60 vs   0.19</p>
<p>    Tax				   2.52 vs   5.57</p>
<p>NOTE: Highlands said exchange losses for the quarter was 1.62 million kina compared with 740,000 kina a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
